{"seq":2,"slug":"consistency-levels","title":"一致性级别、QUORUM 与读写取舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/cassandra-distributed-storage/architecture-consistency/consistency-levels","wordCount":2997,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"一致性级别-quorum-与读写取舍\">一致性级别、QUORUM 与读写取舍</h1><p>Cassandra 把&quot;一次读或写需要多少副本确认&quot;这个决定推迟到了请求时刻,用一致性级别(consistency level, CL)这个参数表达。这是它给应用开发者的唯一一个可调旋钮,也是本 hub 里最容易被误用的一处:选 CL=ONE 然后抱怨读到旧数据,或者选 CL=ALL 然后抱怨不可用,都是把工具用错了方向。这一篇要讲清楚三件事:各个级别的字面含义、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R + W &gt; N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 这个经典不等式在 Cassandra 里的确切边界,以及为什么&quot;看起来更强&quot;的级别往往不是更好的选择。</p>\n<p>先明确一个前提:一致性级别描述的是<strong>这一次操作需要多少个副本应答</strong>,和<strong>数据存了几份</strong>(RF)是两个独立的数字。RF=3 意味着三份副本,CL=QUORUM 意味着这次操作要等其中两份额确认。这两个数字的组合决定了强弱的全部内容,而 Cassandra 保证的是<strong>最终一致</strong>,不是线性一致——即使在最强级别下,它的语义也弱于单机数据库的事务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一次写入的完整生命周期是这样的:客户端把请求发给任意一个节点,这个节点成为本次请求的<strong>协调节点</strong>(coordinator),它根据分区键算出该行属于哪 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个副本,把请求转发给所有副本,收到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 个成功应答后即向客户端返回成功。读请求走同一条路径,但协调节点收集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 份数据后要做<strong>归并</strong>:比较各副本返回的时间戳,取每个列的最新版本作为结果,并顺带把过旧的副本修正到最新——这一步叫<strong>读修复</strong>(read repair)。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  C[&quot;客户端&quot;] --&gt; CO[&quot;协调节点(任意节点)&quot;]&#10;  CO --&gt; N[&quot;按分区键算出 N 个副本&quot;]&#10;  N --&gt; W[&quot;并发写/读所有副本&quot;]&#10;  W --&gt; Q{&quot;成功应答 &gt;= CL 要求?&quot;}&#10;  Q --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| RET[&quot;返回客户端&quot;]&#10;  Q --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| ERR[&quot;Unavailable / Timeout 异常&quot;]&#10;  RET -.-&gt;|&quot;读路径:时间戳归并 + 修正旧副本&quot;| RR[&quot;读修复&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  C[\"客户端\"] --&gt; CO[\"协调节点(任意节点)\"]\n  CO --&gt; N[\"按分区键算出 N 个副本\"]\n  N --&gt; W[\"并发写/读所有副本\"]\n  W --&gt; Q{\"成功应答 &gt;= CL 要求?\"}\n  Q --&gt;|\"是\"| RET[\"返回客户端\"]\n  Q --&gt;|\"否\"| ERR[\"Unavailable / Timeout 异常\"]\n  RET -.-&gt;|\"读路径:时间戳归并 + 修正旧副本\"| RR[\"读修复\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>该 keyspace 的有效副本数(RF)</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>读操作需要的应答数</td>\n<td>QUORUM → 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>写操作需要的应答数</td>\n<td>QUORUM → 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor N/2 \\rfloor + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>QUORUM 的计算式</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> → 2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"一致性级别语义与读写路径\">一致性级别语义与读写路径</h2><p>写入时,协调节点把请求发给所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个副本,收到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 个成功应答即向客户端返回成功,其余副本的应答被忽略(但仍然会送达)。读取时,协调节点把读请求发给所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个副本,收到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 份数据后做<strong>读修复(read repair)</strong>:比较各副本返回的时间戳,把最新的那份作为结果返回,同时把过旧的副本更新到最新版本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  C[&quot;客户端请求 CL=QUORUM&quot;] --&gt; CO[&quot;协调节点&quot;]&#10;  CO --&gt; R1[&quot;副本 1&quot;]&#10;  CO --&gt; R2[&quot;副本 2&quot;]&#10;  CO --&gt; R3[&quot;副本 3&quot;]&#10;  R1 --&gt;|&quot;应答&quot;| AGG[&quot;归并:按时间戳取每列最新版本&quot;]&#10;  R2 --&gt;|&quot;应答&quot;| AGG&#10;  R3 --&gt;|&quot;慢/不可达&quot;| SKIP[&quot;超时后忽略&quot;]&#10;  AGG --&gt; OK{&quot;已收到 &gt;= R 份?&quot;}&#10;  OK --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| RET[&quot;返回结果 + 后台读修复&quot;]&#10;  OK --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| FAIL[&quot;ReadTimeoutException&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  C[\"客户端请求 CL=QUORUM\"] --&gt; CO[\"协调节点\"]\n  CO --&gt; R1[\"副本 1\"]\n  CO --&gt; R2[\"副本 2\"]\n  CO --&gt; R3[\"副本 3\"]\n  R1 --&gt;|\"应答\"| AGG[\"归并:按时间戳取每列最新版本\"]\n  R2 --&gt;|\"应答\"| AGG\n  R3 --&gt;|\"慢/不可达\"| SKIP[\"超时后忽略\"]\n  AGG --&gt; OK{\"已收到 &gt;= R 份?\"}\n  OK --&gt;|\"是\"| RET[\"返回结果 + 后台读修复\"]\n  OK --&gt;|\"否\"| FAIL[\"ReadTimeoutException\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>需要的应答数</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ONE</code></td>\n<td>1(通常选择最近的副本)</td>\n<td>最低延迟,允许读到旧值</td>\n<td>缓存回填、日志、可容忍陈旧的报表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TWO</code> / <code>THREE</code></td>\n<td>2 / 3</td>\n<td>介于 ONE 与 QUORUM 之间</td>\n<td>多机房下折中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>QUORUM</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor N/2 \\rfloor + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>多数派,R+W 可组强一致</td>\n<td>一般业务读写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LOCAL_QUORUM</code></td>\n<td>本机房内多数派</td>\n<td>不跨机房等待,机房内强一致</td>\n<td>多机房生产环境默认推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>EACH_QUORUM</code></td>\n<td><strong>每个机房</strong>各自多数派</td>\n<td>仅对写有意义</td>\n<td>要求所有机房同时写入成功的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ALL</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>任一副本不可用即失败</td>\n<td>几乎不该在生产使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LOCAL_ONE</code></td>\n<td>本机房 1 个</td>\n<td>延迟最低的机房内读</td>\n<td>只读副本、延迟敏感读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SERIAL</code> / <code>LOCAL_SERIAL</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>轻量事务(LWT)专用,走 Paxos</td>\n<td>条件更新、唯一性约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（级别划分与语义依据 Apache Cassandra 官方 Dynamo 文档与 native protocol v4 规范,后者把协议层的一致性级别编码为 <code>0x0000 ANY … 0x000A LOCAL_ONE</code>,来源：<a href=\"https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/architecture/dynamo.html\">https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/architecture/dynamo.html</a> 与 <a href=\"https://github.com/apache/cassandra/blob/trunk/doc/native_protocol_v4.spec\">https://github.com/apache/cassandra/blob/trunk/doc/native_protocol_v4.spec</a> ）</p>\n<p>两个容易被忽略的细节。其一,<strong><code>LOCAL_QUORUM</code> 的&quot;本地&quot;由客户端的连接节点决定</strong>——官方定义是&quot;a majority of the replicas in the local datacenter (whichever datacenter the coordinator is in) must respond&quot;,所以如果客户端连到了错误的机房,<code>LOCAL_QUORUM</code> 会静默变成跨机房等待,延迟暴涨而不报错。生产环境的驱动必须显式配置本地机房(<code>loadBalancingPolicy</code> 中的 <code>localDc</code>)。其二,<code>ANY</code> 这个写入专用级别允许<strong>在没有任何副本在线时</strong>写入 hinted handoff 暂存区就返回成功——官方描述是&quot;a single replica may respond, or the coordinator may store a hint … This consistency level is only accepted for write operations&quot;,这是唯一一个&quot;写入可能根本还没落到任何副本上&quot;的级别,除了极特殊的可用性优先场景不要使用。（来源：Apache Cassandra 5.0 官方文档 — Dynamo / Tunable Consistency, <a href=\"https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/architecture/dynamo.html\">https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/architecture/dynamo.html</a> ）</p>\n<h2 id=\"r-w-n-的确切边界\">R + W &gt; N 的确切边界</h2><p>经典结论是:如果读的一致级别 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 与写的一致级别 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R + W &gt; N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>那么读集合与写集合必然有交集,读至少能碰到一份包含最新写入的副本,从而保证<strong>读到最近一次成功写入的值</strong>。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 时,<code>QUORUM</code>/<code>QUORUM</code> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2+2&gt;3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>,是强一致组合;<code>ONE</code>/<code>ONE</code> 不满足(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>≯</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\ngtr 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9115em;vertical-align:-0.2058em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>),可能读到旧值。官方文档把这条写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W + R &gt; RF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>,并明确 <code>QUORUM</code> 的定义是&quot;a majority (n/2 + 1) of the replicas must respond&quot;。（来源：Apache Cassandra 5.0 官方文档 — Dynamo / Picking Consistency Levels, <a href=\"https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/architecture/dynamo.html\">https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/architecture/dynamo.html</a> ）</p>\n<p>这个不等式有几个必须知道的边界条件,它们在真实系统里频繁触发:</p>\n<p><strong>条件一:必须在同一个机房内计算。</strong> <code>LOCAL_QUORUM</code> 在双机房 RF=3 的部署下,每个机房各自满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2+2&gt;3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>,机房内强一致;但跨机房不保证——北京刚写入的值通过跨机房异步复制到上海,在此之前上海的 <code>LOCAL_QUORUM</code> 读会拿到旧值。这不是 bug,这是设计:多机房部署用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EACH_QUORUM</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EACH\\_QUORUM}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EACH_QUORUM</span></span></span></span></span></span> 或跨机房 <code>QUORUM</code> 才能保证全局,代价是延迟。</p>\n<p><strong>条件二:并发写同一列时,时间戳决定胜者,而非 CL。</strong> Cassandra 用<strong>客户端或协调节点生成的微秒级时间戳</strong>做冲突裁决,较大者胜出,与到达顺序无关。这意味着两台客户端时钟不同步时,一台机器上&quot;更晚发生的写入&quot;可能因为时钟偏慢而在冲突中落败,数据永久停在旧值上。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R+W&gt;N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 保证&quot;读能看到最新的已提交写入&quot;,但它不保证&quot;最新的写入就是逻辑上最后发生的那次&quot;。这是 Cassandra 与单机数据库最本质的语义差异,也是生产环境必须跑 NTP 同步的原因——官方在把 <code>cross_node_timeout</code> 默认改为 true 时给出的理由正是&quot;时钟基本同步是 last write wins 正确性的要求&quot;。（来源：Apache Cassandra 4.0 NEWS.txt — CASSANDRA-15216, <a href=\"https://github.com/apache/cassandra/blob/trunk/NEWS.txt\">https://github.com/apache/cassandra/blob/trunk/NEWS.txt</a> ）</p>\n<p><strong>条件三:轻量事务是例外。</strong> 涉及 LWT(<code>IF NOT EXISTS</code>、<code>IF &lt;col&gt; = &lt;val&gt;</code>)的写走 Paxos 而非普通复制路径,它需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SERIAL</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 级别。混用 LWT 与普通写的表要特别小心,Paxos 提交的写会覆盖普通写的值,即使普通写的时间戳更大。这套机制已经超出本篇范围,记住结论即可:<strong>需要对某一列做条件更新时,读写该列都应该用 <code>SERIAL</code>/<code>LOCAL_SERIAL</code>,不要混用。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>条件四:读修复不能替代 repair。</strong> 读修复只在<strong>读到的副本之间</strong>比较并补齐差距,对于那些从来没有被读到的分区,差距会一直存在。这就是为什么第四章的 <code>nodetool repair</code> 仍然是必做项——见 <a href=\"../operations/repair-hints\">nodetool repair、hints 与一致性修复</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟-可用性与失败重试\">延迟、可用性与失败重试</h2><p>一致性级别直接决定请求对<strong>尾部延迟</strong>的敏感度。优雅降级(spectrum)是这样的:<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 时,<code>ONE</code> 只需要最快的那个副本应答,<code>QUORUM</code> 需要第二快,<code>ALL</code> 需要最慢的。工程上这意味着一句很实在的话:<strong><code>QUORUM</code> 的延迟约等于 p95 级别的单副本延迟,<code>ALL</code> 的延迟约等于 p99+ 级别的单副本延迟</strong>。在副本跨可用区部署时,这个差距可能是几毫秒与几十毫秒的差别。</p>\n<p>失败语义同样要分清:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>可用性判断</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>UnavailableException</code></td>\n<td>协调节点在<strong>发请求前</strong>就知道副本数不够</td>\n<td>快速失败,不消耗重试预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ReadTimeoutException</code> / <code>WriteTimeoutException</code></td>\n<td>请求已发出但未在超时内收到足够应答</td>\n<td>可能部分成功,重试需幂等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WriteFailureException</code></td>\n<td>写入过程中出现非超时错误(如磁盘故障)</td>\n<td>需要人工介入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ReadFailureException</code></td>\n<td>读取过程中出现非超时错误</td>\n<td>通常是磁盘或校验和问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>WriteTimeoutException</code> 特别值得警惕:<strong>它不代表写入失败</strong>。协调节点可能已经把数据写到了若干副本,只是没等到第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 份确认就超时了。此时盲目重试会写第二遍(通常无害,因为同值覆盖,但如果写入含 <code>USING TIMESTAMP</code> 或计数器操作就会出问题)。正确的策略是把写操作设计成幂等的——基于主键的覆盖写天然幂等,而计数器与 list 的 append 不是。</p>\n<p>驱动侧的<strong>重试策略</strong>必须按异常类型区分:对 <code>UnavailableException</code> 可以在下一个副本上重试;对超时必须连着<strong>同一 CL</strong> 重试并且要限次;对 <code>ALL</code> 级别的失败通常放弃。Java 驱动提供 <code>RetryPolicy</code>,默认策略已经区分了这几类,自定义时要显式指定 <code>onUnavailable</code>、<code>onReadTimeout</code>、<code>onWriteTimeout</code> 三个回调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性级别的实际选型\">一致性级别的实际选型</h2><p>把上面的规则翻译成可执行的选型建议:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>写入 CL</th>\n<th>读取 CL</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单机房一般业务</td>\n<td><code>QUORUM</code></td>\n<td><code>QUORUM</code></td>\n<td>R+W&gt;N,机房内强一致,可用性容忍 1 个副本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多机房、读本地优先</td>\n<td><code>LOCAL_QUORUM</code></td>\n<td><code>LOCAL_QUORUM</code></td>\n<td>不跨机房等待;机房内一致,接受跨机房最终一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多机房、要求全局强一致</td>\n<td><code>EACH_QUORUM</code></td>\n<td><code>QUORUM</code></td>\n<td>写入需所有机房确认;延迟最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高吞吐写入(日志/事件)</td>\n<td><code>LOCAL_ONE</code></td>\n<td><code>ONE</code></td>\n<td>写放大最小;读取端做幂等与去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序数据、幂等覆盖写</td>\n<td><code>ONE</code></td>\n<td><code>ONE</code></td>\n<td>时间戳语义使重复写无害;层压实负责收敛(见第三章)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要条件更新</td>\n<td><code>LOCAL_SERIAL</code></td>\n<td><code>LOCAL_SERIAL</code></td>\n<td>走 Paxos;不要与普通写混用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>几个反直觉但正确的结论:</p>\n<p><strong>写 <code>ONE</code> 读 <code>ONE</code> 并不意味着数据会丢。</strong> 只要所有副本最终都收到写入(即使是靠 hinted handoff 或 repair),数据就在。<code>ONE</code>/<code>ONE</code> 牺牲的是&quot;读到最新值&quot;的时序保证,不是持久性——持久性由 commitlog 和 RF 保证,与 CL 无关。</p>\n<p><strong><code>ALL</code> 很少是正确答案。</strong> 它把可用性降到&quot;任一副本故障即写入失败&quot;,而在一个 12 节点集群里,单节点故障是常态而非异常。需要&quot;所有副本都确认&quot;的真实场景通常是审计合规,而这类需求用 <code>EACH_QUORUM</code> 或应用层确认更合适。</p>\n<p><strong><code>LOCAL_QUORUM</code> 是多数生产系统的默认答案。</strong> 它在机房内提供 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R+W&gt;N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的强一致,又完全不依赖跨机房链路。多机房部署的常规做法是每机房都读写自己的 <code>LOCAL_QUORUM</code>,跨机房的一致性由异步复制 + 定期 repair 收敛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一致性级别 = 本次操作需要多少个副本应答,与 RF(存几份)正交;两者组合决定强弱。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R + W &gt; N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 提供&quot;读到最近一次成功写入&quot;的保证,但必须在<strong>同一机房内</strong>计算,且多机房部署需要 <code>LOCAL_QUORUM</code> 而非裸 <code>QUORUM</code>。</li>\n<li>冲突裁决靠微秒时间戳而非 CL,时钟不同步会让&quot;更晚的写&quot;落败;NTP 是正确性依赖,不是运维洁癖。</li>\n<li>延迟上 <code>QUORUM</code> 约等于单副本 p95,<code>ALL</code> 约等于 p99+;多副本跨可用区时差距明显。</li>\n<li><code>WriteTimeoutException</code> 不等于写失败,重试策略必须按异常类型区分,并且写入应尽量设计为幂等。</li>\n<li>生产默认:<code>LOCAL_QUORUM</code> 读写;高吞吐场景 <code>ONE</code>;条件更新走 <code>SERIAL</code>/<code>LOCAL_SERIAL</code>,绝不与普通写混用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一致性级别解决的是&quot;这一刻读什么&quot;,但副本暂时不可达时写进去的数据去哪了、被删除的数据为什么会在 repair 之后消失,这些属于下一个问题——见 <a href=\"hinted-handoff-seda\">hinted handoff、墓碑与删除语义</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"一致性级别、QUORUM 与读写取舍","id":"一致性级别-quorum-与读写取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性级别语义与读写路径","id":"一致性级别语义与读写路径"},{"level":2,"text":"R + W > N 的确切边界","id":"r-w-n-的确切边界"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟、可用性与失败重试","id":"延迟-可用性与失败重试"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性级别的实际选型","id":"一致性级别的实际选型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Gossip、一致性哈希环与虚拟节点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/cassandra-distributed-storage/architecture-consistency/gossip-ring-tokens"},"next":{"title":"hinted handoff、墓碑与删除语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/cassandra-distributed-storage/architecture-consistency/hinted-handoff-seda"}}